Third-party notices for the session-grep binary

The session-grep binary in the release archives is compiled from bin/session-grep
with Spinel (https://github.com/matz/spinel) at the commit in .spinel-version
(d2449044a4901bc3b8b63e149fd61f83995b2418). Besides session-grep itself (see
